# AirSense Delhi - API Configuration
# Get your free tokens below:

# 1. WAQI (World Air Quality Index) Free API Token:
# Get free token here: https://aqicn.org/data-platform/token/
WAQI_API_KEY=your_waqi_api_key_here

# 2. OpenAQ Free API Key:
# Register free key here: https://openaq.org/
OPENAQ_API_KEY=your_openaq_api_key_here

# 3. NASA FIRMS Satellite Fire Map Key (for live stubble burning fire detections):
# Get free key here: https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/api/map_key/
NASA_FIRMS_MAP_KEY=your_nasa_firms_key_here

# 4. Optional Vercel Ingestion Cron Security Secret:
CRON_SECRET=airsense_delhi_secure_cron_token_123
